/docs/superpowers
/.superpowers

# Agent tooling. `.claude/` is ignored by default because Claude Code writes
# machine-local scratch there (worktrees, caches, per-user settings), but the
# shared parts are meant to be committed and reviewed like any other config —
# so they're re-included below. Agent *instructions* live in /AGENTS.md, which
# is tracked normally and is not affected by any of this.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/commands/
!/.claude/agents/
!/.claude/settings.json
# Never share: local overrides and Claude Code's own working directories.
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/worktrees/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/

# Secrets — every service also has its own .gitignore rule, but keep a
# repo-wide backstop so a new service can never leak a filled-in .env.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example